*** Variables ***
# Variables for ue profile and traffic
${ue_1_id}            1            # Applied only for KW SA Call of 1 UE
${ue_1_pdu}           1            # Applied only for KW SA Call of 1 UE
${ue_1_gw}            1            # Applied only for KW SA Call of 1 UE
${qfi_nonGBR}         1            # Applied only for KW SA Call of 1 UE
${dl_tput_mbps}       50           # Applied only for KW SA Call of 1 UE
${ul_tput_mbps}       10           # Applied only for KW SA Call of 1 UE
#${traffic_duration}   10            # Applied only for KW SA Call of 1 UE
${CallType}           SA           # NSA or SA (for all UEs)
${Cell}               1            # Target cell (must be index 1, 2, 3, 4, 5...)
${TrafficDuration}    20           # Traffic Duration  (0 means no traffic)
${DLthroughput}       50           # DL throughput in Mbps
${ULthroughput}       10           # UL throughput in Mbps
#Variables to Build UEs list and Setup WTS Lua
${gNbID}              2            # Value of the Target_gnb
${CellID}             1            # Retrieved from NRCELL_ID_LIST items [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, None, None, None]
${UEnb}               1            # Number of UEs to "attach/traffic/detach" simultaneously per cell
#${nbSaUe}            2
${loopIND}            1
${LoopNb}             1            # Number of loops "attach/traffic/detach"




#Variables for TC 1227 Cell Addition
${Cell_UNLOCK}      UNLOCK
${Cell_LOCK}        LOCK

*** Keywords ***

#####1227-C#####
TC 1227 Cell Addition
    [Documentation]     Verification of dynamic PRB allocation after cell Addition and cell delete using RR Algo

    [Arguments]            ${params}        ${Vendor_Param}
    Set Suite Variable     ${params}
    Init Sequence          ${params}
    Step                   Set RAD Params Of 1227 
    Step                   Config1227.Vendor File Config With Specific Settings     argument=${Vendor_Param}          
    Step                   Config1227.Update 1227 Params in OAM SCF
    Critical Step          Restart TL
    Step                   Multi Cells Setup SA 1227                  argument=${params.nbCell}
    Step                   SA Call With UE Id   argument=${ue_1_id}
    Step                   SA Call With UE Id   argument=${ue_3_id}
    Step                   Activate Sherpa On All Cells
    Step                   Wait In Seconds
    Step                   Stop Sherpa Collection
    Step                   Test Check PrbPoolingAllocationReport 3Cells
    Step                   Cell Lock
    Step                   Activate Sherpa On All Cells
    Step                   Wait In Seconds
    Step                   Stop Sherpa Collection
    Step                   Test Check PrbPoolingAllocationReport 2Cells
    Step                   Cell Unlock
    Step                   Wait 10min
    Step                   SA Call of 1 UE
    Step                   Activate Sherpa On All Cells
    Step                   Wait In Seconds
    Step                   Stop Sherpa Collection
    Step                   Test Check PrbPoolingAllocationReport 3Cells

Wait 10min
    Sleep       600s

Cell Lock
    Oam.OAM Cell Lock  cell_id=1
    Dated Log   Current status of cell 1 is blocked

Cell Unlock
    Oam.OAM Cell Lock  state=UNLOCK     cell_id=1
    Dated Log   Current status of cell 1 is unblocked

Test Check PrbPoolingAllocationReport 3Cells
    [Documentation]                  post-processing on micro__l1l2Trace.csv to check that event 45 is reported for
    ...                              both Cell1, Cell3 (L1subpool 0), cell 2 (L1Subpool 1) when no cell is locked
    [Arguments]
    @{result}                        Check Regex Value In File Column With Prerequisite
    ...                              file=${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/micro__l1l2Trace.csv
    ...                              Column_name=MSGID
    ...                              regex_prereq=Dl PrbPoolingAllocationReport
    # ...                              regex_tocheck=.+;*NRCellid=1638[5-7];*
    ...                              regex_tocheck=.+;*NRCellid=0x400[1-3];*
    ${EVENT45_presence} =      Get From List    ${result}    0
    should be true                   ${EVENT45_presence}==True
    BuiltIn.Log    ${EVENT45_presence}    console=yes

    ${EVENT45_list} =      Get From List    ${result}    1
    BuiltIn.Log    ${EVENT45_list}    console=yes
    ${check_EVENT45_presence} =     Set Variable If   ${EVENT45_presence}==True
    ...                 Dl PrbPoolingAllocationReport(45) is present for both cell 1, 2, 3
    ...                                               ${EVENT45_presence}==False
    ...                 Dl PrbPoolingAllocationReport(45) check failed

    Dated Log                        Analyse in sherpa traces : PrbPoolingAllocationReport for 3 Cells

Test Check PrbPoolingAllocationReport 2Cells
    [Documentation]                  post-processing on micro__l1l2Trace.csv to check that event 45 is reported for
    ...                              Cell2 and Cell3 (NRCellid=16387) when cell 1 is locked
    [Arguments]
    @{result}                        Check Regex Value In File Column With Prerequisite
    ...                              file=${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/micro__l1l2Trace.csv
    ...                              Column_name=MSGID
    ...                              regex_prereq=Dl PrbPoolingAllocationReport
    # ...                              regex_tocheck=.+;*NRCellid=1638[6-7];*
    ...                              regex_tocheck=.+;*NRCellid=0x400[2-3];*
    ${EVENT45_presence} =      Get From List    ${result}    0
    should be true                   ${EVENT45_presence}==True
    BuiltIn.Log    ${EVENT45_presence}    console=yes

    ${EVENT45_list} =      Get From List    ${result}    1
    BuiltIn.Log    ${EVENT45_list}    console=yes
    ${check_EVENT45_presence} =     Set Variable If   ${EVENT45_presence}==True
    ...                 Dl PrbPoolingAllocationReport(45) is present for Cell 2, 3 only
    ...                                               ${EVENT45_presence}==False
    ...                 Dl PrbPoolingAllocationReport(45) check failed

    Dated Log                        Analyse in sherpa traces : PrbPoolingAllocationReport for Cell 2 & 3



